    "Panel (b): large blue circle centered right of panel midline",
    "Fixed point P: filled blue dot on the curve (left flank in (a), upper-left of circle in (b)) with italic label P",
    "Moving point Q: filled blue dot farther along the curve, with italic label Q",
    "Family of pink/magenta secant lines through P and successive Q positions, fanning from a shallow slope up to the steep limiting line",
