    "Text label 'Secant line' at the right end of the shallowest secant",
    "Text label 'Tangent line' near the steep limiting line",
    "Panel captions '(a)' and '(b)' centered beneath each drawing",
    "Readout box showing current Q coordinates, the run h = xQ − xP, and the secant slope (Δy/Δx) alongside the limiting tangent slope"
